    {
        "content": "<p>Related: <a href=\"#narrow/channel/270676-lean4/topic/What.20to.20call.20the.20Lean.203.20.60change.20.2E.2E.2E.20with.20.2E.2E.2E.60.20tactic.3F\">#lean4 &gt; What to call the Lean 3 &#96;change ... with ...&#96; tactic?</a></p>",
        "id": 580815326,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1774096897
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I also asked about it here: <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113488\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/.22change.20with.22.20tactic/with/577912340\">#general &gt; \"change with\" tactic</a> <br>\nApparently, there was a tactic in Lean 3 that could be implemented in Lean 4 but it is low-priority. This tactic is only \"declared\" but not implemented. So just accept it is not available.</p>",
